            <ArticleTitle>Ultratine retention: report of a case.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>501-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/IOP.0b013e3181b8c3c5</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Ultratine device, like its predecessor the Endotine, is a commonly used device for brow and forehead elevation. The authors report a case of cyst formation with pain at the site of Ultratine implantation, requiring removal.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
